{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/js-9-event/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Overblog","author":"zitup"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"29c574b3-74c3-5d50-93bc-5ad3d7896631","html":"<p>本篇聚焦于 JS 中的事件系统。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E6%B5%81\">事件流</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#%E5%86%92%E6%B3%A1\">冒泡</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#%E6%8D%95%E8%8E%B7\">捕获</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#dom-%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E6%B5%81\">DOM 事件流</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F\">事件处理程序</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#html-%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F\">HTML 事件处理程序</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#dom0-%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F\">DOM0 事件处理程序</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#dom2-%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F\">DOM2 事件处理程序</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1\">事件对象</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E5%B1%9E%E6%80%A7\">事件属性</a></li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95\">事件方法</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#eventcomposedpath\"><code class=\"language-text\">Event.composedPath()</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#eventpreventdefault\"><code class=\"language-text\">Event.preventDefault()</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#eventstopimmediatepropagation\"><code class=\"language-text\">Event.stopImmediatePropagation()</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#eventstoppropagation\"><code class=\"language-text\">Event.stopPropagation()</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B\">常用事件类型</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#uievent-%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E7%95%8C%E9%9D%A2%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6\">UIEvent 用户界面事件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#focusevent-%E7%84%A6%E7%82%B9%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6\">FocusEvent 焦点事件</a></li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#mouseevent-%E9%BC%A0%E6%A0%87%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6\">MouseEvent 鼠标事件</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#%E5%B1%9E%E6%80%A7\">属性</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a href=\"#touchevent-%E8%A7%A6%E6%91%B8%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6\">TouchEvent 触摸事件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#wheelevent-%E6%BB%9A%E8%BD%AE%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6\">WheelEvent 滚轮事件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#inputevent-%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6\">InputEvent 输入事件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#keyboardevent-%E9%94%AE%E7%9B%98%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6\">KeyboardEvent 键盘事件</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"事件流\"><a href=\"#%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E6%B5%81\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>事件流</h2>\n<p>事件流描述了页面接受事件的顺序。</p>\n<h3 id=\"冒泡\"><a href=\"#%E5%86%92%E6%B3%A1\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>冒泡</h3>\n<p>冒泡是 IE 定义的一种事件流的方式，被定义为从最具体的元素开始触发，然后向上传播。现代浏览器中的事件会一直冒泡到 window 对象。</p>\n<h3 id=\"捕获\"><a href=\"#%E6%8D%95%E8%8E%B7\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>捕获</h3>\n<p>捕获是网景提出的事件流方式，意思是从最外层先收到事件，向最具体的元素传播。现代浏览器都是从 window 对象开始捕获。</p>\n<h3 id=\"dom-事件流\"><a href=\"#dom-%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E6%B5%81\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>DOM 事件流</h3>\n<p>DOM2 Events 规范规定事件分为 3 个阶段：事件捕获、到达目标和事件冒泡。事件捕获最先发生，然后实际的目标元素触发事件，最后一个阶段是冒泡。</p>\n<p>DOM2 Events 规范明确在捕获阶段不命中目标元素，但是现代浏览器都会在捕获阶段也触发目标元素的事件，即目标元素上的事件会触发两次。</p>\n<h2 id=\"事件处理程序\"><a href=\"#%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>事件处理程序</h2>\n<p>事件处理程序表示响应事件的函数。</p>\n<h3 id=\"html-事件处理程序\"><a href=\"#html-%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>HTML 事件处理程序</h3>\n<p>HTML 属性可以接受事件处理程序。属性名称一般以 <code class=\"language-text\">on</code> 开头</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"html\"><pre class=\"language-html\"><code class=\"language-html\">  <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>button</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">onclick</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">'</span>console.log(<span class=\"token punctuation\">'</span>Clicked<span class=\"token punctuation\">'</span>)<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>Click<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>button</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span></code></pre></div>\n<p>HTML 事件处理程序的主要缺点，就是 HTML 和  JS 强耦合，代码混在一起很乱。</p>\n<h3 id=\"dom0-事件处理程序\"><a href=\"#dom0-%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>DOM0 事件处理程序</h3>\n<p>在 JS 中为定义事件可以使用元素属性，比如 <code class=\"language-text\">onclick</code>，把事件处理函数赋给它即可:</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\">  <span class=\"token keyword\">let</span> btn <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> document<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">getElementById</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"myBtn\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  btn<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function-variable function\">onclick</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">function</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Clicked\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> </code></pre></div>\n<p>函数内的 this 为元素本身。这种方式定义的事件，注册在事件流的冒泡阶段。</p>\n<p>可以通过将属性设为 <code class=\"language-text\">null</code> 来移除事件。</p>\n<h3 id=\"dom2-事件处理程序\"><a href=\"#dom2-%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>DOM2 事件处理程序</h3>\n<p>DOM2 Events 添加了两个方法：<code class=\"language-text\">addEventListener</code> 和 <code class=\"language-text\">removeEventListener</code>，这种方式也是我们现在最常用的事件添加和移除方式。</p>\n<p>它们可以控制是在捕获阶段还是冒泡阶段处理事件:</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\">  <span class=\"token keyword\">let</span> btn <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> document<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">getElementById</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"myBtn\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  btn<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">addEventListener</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"click\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>id<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">false</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// 第三个参数默认为 false，表示在冒泡阶段处理，true 为在捕获阶段</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">addEventListener</code> 可以为同一个元素同一个事件添加多个事件处理程序，按添加的顺序执行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"事件对象\"><a href=\"#%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>事件对象</h2>\n<p>Event 对象包含了事件相关的信息。Event 对象是默认传给事件处理程序的唯一参数。</p>\n<h3 id=\"事件属性\"><a href=\"#%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E5%B1%9E%E6%80%A7\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>事件属性</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">属性</th>\n<th align=\"left\">类型</th>\n<th align=\"left\">说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">bubbles</td>\n<td align=\"left\">布尔值</td>\n<td align=\"left\">表示事件是否冒泡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">cancelable</td>\n<td align=\"left\">布尔值</td>\n<td align=\"left\">表示是否可以取消事件的默认行为</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">target</td>\n<td align=\"left\">元素</td>\n<td align=\"left\">触发事件的目标元素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">currentTarget</td>\n<td align=\"left\">元素</td>\n<td align=\"left\">当前事件处理程序所在的元素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">defaultPrevented</td>\n<td align=\"left\">布尔值</td>\n<td align=\"left\">true 表示已经调用了 preventDefault() 方法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">eventPhase</td>\n<td align=\"left\">整数</td>\n<td align=\"left\">表示调用事件处理程序的阶段：<br/>1-捕获 2-目标元素 3-冒泡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">composed</td>\n<td align=\"left\">布尔值</td>\n<td align=\"left\">表示事件是否可以跨越shadow DOM <br/>向 standard DOM 传播</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">isTrusted</td>\n<td align=\"left\">布尔值</td>\n<td align=\"left\">true 表示事件是否由浏览器生成，<br>false 表示由开发者创建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">timeStamp</td>\n<td align=\"left\">整数</td>\n<td align=\"left\">表示事件触发时距离事件创建时的时间，<br>单位为毫秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">type</td>\n<td align=\"left\">字符串</td>\n<td align=\"left\">触发事件的类型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"事件方法\"><a href=\"#%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>事件方法</h3>\n<h4 id=\"eventcomposedpath\"><a href=\"#eventcomposedpath\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a><code class=\"language-text\">Event.composedPath()</code></h4>\n<p>shadow DOM 相关。略</p>\n<h4 id=\"eventpreventdefault\"><a href=\"#eventpreventdefault\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a><code class=\"language-text\">Event.preventDefault()</code></h4>\n<p>取消事件的默认行为，比如取消链接的默认跳转行为。</p>\n<p>事件对象的 <code class=\"language-text\">cancelable</code> 为 true 时，可以通过此方法取消默认行为。但是不会影响事件继续传播。</p>\n<h4 id=\"eventstopimmediatepropagation\"><a href=\"#eventstopimmediatepropagation\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a><code class=\"language-text\">Event.stopImmediatePropagation()</code></h4>\n<p>阻止当前元素上所有的后续同类型事件，包括捕获阶段和冒泡阶段。</p>\n<h4 id=\"eventstoppropagation\"><a href=\"#eventstoppropagation\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a><code class=\"language-text\">Event.stopPropagation()</code></h4>\n<p>阻止当前事件在捕获和冒泡阶段的后续传播。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常用事件类型\"><a href=\"#%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>常用事件类型</h2>\n<h3 id=\"uievent-用户界面事件\"><a href=\"#uievent-%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E7%95%8C%E9%9D%A2%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>UIEvent 用户界面事件</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>error</li>\n<li>select</li>\n<li>resize</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"focusevent-焦点事件\"><a href=\"#focusevent-%E7%84%A6%E7%82%B9%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>FocusEvent 焦点事件</h3>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">Event &lt;-- UIEvent &lt;-- FocusEvent</code></p>\n<ul>\n<li>focus</li>\n<li>blur</li>\n<li>focusin</li>\n<li>focusout</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"mouseevent-鼠标事件\"><a href=\"#mouseevent-%E9%BC%A0%E6%A0%87%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>MouseEvent 鼠标事件</h3>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">Event &lt;-- UIEvent &lt;-- MouseEvent</code></p>\n<ul>\n<li>click</li>\n<li>dblclick</li>\n<li>mousedown</li>\n<li>mouseenter</li>\n<li>mouseleave</li>\n<li>mousemove</li>\n<li>mouseout</li>\n<li>mouseover</li>\n<li>mouseup</li>\n</ul>\n<p>click 事件触发的前提是 mousedown 事件触发后，紧接着又在同一个元素上触发了 mouseup\n事件。如果 mousedown 和 mouseup 中的任意一个事件被取消，那么 click 事件就不会触发。类似地，\n两次连续的 click 事件会导致 dblclick 事件触发。只要有任何逻辑阻止了这两个 click 事件发生（比\n如取消其中一个 click 事件或者取消 mousedown 或 mouseup 事件中的任一个），dblclick 事件就不\n会发生。这 4 个事件永远会按照如下顺序触发：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>(1) mousedown</li>\n<li>(2) mouseup</li>\n<li>(3) click</li>\n<li>(4) mousedown</li>\n<li>(5) mouseup</li>\n<li>(6) click</li>\n<li>(7) dblclick</li>\n</ul>\n<p>click 和 dblclick 在触发前都依赖其他事件触发，mousedown 和 mouseup 则不会受其他事件影响。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>摘自红宝书 4</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h4 id=\"属性\"><a href=\"#%E5%B1%9E%E6%80%A7\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>属性</h4>\n<p>鼠标事件包含了很多特有的属性。略。</p>\n<h3 id=\"touchevent-触摸事件\"><a href=\"#touchevent-%E8%A7%A6%E6%91%B8%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>TouchEvent 触摸事件</h3>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">Event &lt;-- UIEvent &lt;-- TouchEvent</code></p>\n<ul>\n<li>touchcancel</li>\n<li>touchend</li>\n<li>touchmove</li>\n<li>touchstart</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"wheelevent-滚轮事件\"><a href=\"#wheelevent-%E6%BB%9A%E8%BD%AE%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>WheelEvent 滚轮事件</h3>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">Event &lt;-- UIEvent &lt;-- MouseEvent &lt;-- WheelEvent</code></p>\n<ul>\n<li>wheel</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"inputevent-输入事件\"><a href=\"#inputevent-%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>InputEvent 输入事件</h3>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">Event &lt;-- UIEvent &lt;-- InputEvent</code></p>\n<ul>\n<li>beforeInput</li>\n<li>input</li>\n<li>change</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"keyboardevent-键盘事件\"><a href=\"#keyboardevent-%E9%94%AE%E7%9B%98%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>KeyboardEvent 键盘事件</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>keydown</li>\n<li>keypress</li>\n<li>keyup</li>\n</ul>\n<p>属性略。</p>\n<p>相关知识:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn/JavaScript/Building_blocks/Events\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn/JavaScript/Building_blocks/Events</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p>JS 中的事件很复杂，种类多，各种规范也很乱，以上只是 Event 的简单脉络，不过也达到本系列的目的了。</p>","timeToRead":9,"frontmatter":{"title":"Event","date":"December 30, 2021","spoiler":"JS 第九篇之 Event","cta":"JS"},"fields":{"slug":"/js-9-event/","langKey":"en"}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/js-9-event/","previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/js-8-network-request/","langKey":"en","directoryName":"js-8-network-request"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Network requests"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/js-10-array/","langKey":"en","directoryName":"js-10-array"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Array"}},"translations":[],"translatedLinks":[]}},"staticQueryHashes":["708209134"]}